# Reverse-engineering scratch: one-off probes written while working out
# DeepSeek's PoW (the WASM calling convention, the hash algorithm) and manual
# login/chat drivers. They are useful to keep around locally and are not part of
# the service -- the Dockerfile ships only `deepseek pow_solver.py
# sha3_wasm_bg.wasm server.py`, and nothing in the codebase imports any of
# these. They were committed by accident in 6f12c27; ignoring them keeps that
# from happening twice. Some hardcode absolute paths under /Users, which is the
# clearest sign they were never meant to be shared.
chat_test.py
login_test.py
solve_wasm.mjs
wasm_hash.mjs
wasm_verify.mjs
wasm_verify2.mjs
